---
metadata:
  layer: test
  scope: "tests/{name}/"
  version: "1.0"
  description: "Test layer structure and responsibility boundaries"

scope:
  covers:
    - "{primary responsibility}"
  NOT:
    - "{explicit out-of-scope item} → {actual location}"

cross_references:
  - target: "../{adjacent}/"
    boundary: "Boundary description"

agent_rules:
  test_naming: "{name}_test.* or test_{name}.*"
---

# Test layer

Scope boundaries (including an explicit NOT-list), naming, and edges to
neighboring test directories.
